Final note (non-negotiable)
---------------------------
Do not spend another full 24h training cycle until:
  (1) Proxy viability diagnostic gates pass, and
  (2) Intermediate diagnostic shows topology-dependent robustness separation under the chosen perturbation.

This patch explicitly aligns Plot 2 with the WS-Flex (C,L) “design space” framing in Waqas et al.,
fixes the proxy collapse caused by ORC≈k, and restores the logic needed to defend the “inversion”
claim with A/B/C baselines in a reviewer-proof way.
